# NOTE ON PROCESSED DATA (data/processed/):
# The processed data files (transactions.parquet [94.5MB], edges.parquet [2.45MB], 
# transaction_graph.pkl [11.95MB], models/ [5.3MB]) are REQUIRED for deployment.
# They are under GitHub's 100 MB hard limit.
